ras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.poster.avif?t=1724408422\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.webm?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/1d34979c6fcb7a19431159894f26fd23.mp4?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u>Different gameplay and not just a shoot'em up:</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/a9128a97787975ca97c8c5d9b5d4b979.avif?t=1724408422\" width=640 height=341 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tenacious and original Bosses:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/e564cbcffb2c996c284062f010fbe43e.avif?t=1724408422\" width=640 height=371 /></span><br><br><strong>And a Survival Mode, with a leaderboard:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/846db7d20cbd61f26ecc587ce2f5b746.poster.avif?t=1724408422\" width=550 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/846db7d20cbd61f26ecc587ce2f5b746.webm?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849260/extras/846db7d20cbd61f26ecc587ce2f5b746.mp4?t=1724408422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What makes Jash unique?</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different gameplay, the spirit and ambiance of the game.<br></li><li>Throughout the game, you will go from surprises to surprises.<br></li><li>During the game, you will also have the pleasure of discovering many references 